        <div class="r-proj-card">
          <div class="r-proj-name">SynapseGo</div>
          <div class="r-proj-partner">1st-Person VLM Video Analysis</div>
          <div class="r-proj-desc">
            End-to-end first-person video understanding platform using Vision-Language Models. Supports real-time scene narration, object tracking, and action recognition from wearable camera streams.
          </div>
          <div class="r-badges" style="margin-top:10px;">
            <span class="badge" style="font-size:10.5px;">VLM</span>
            <span class="badge" style="font-size:10.5px;">Egocentric</span>
            <span class="badge" style="font-size:10.5px;">Real-time</span>
