            Real-time event detection and analysis platform for industrial safety and physical security. Multi-camera ingestion with sub-second anomaly alerting, deployed at scale across manufacturing sites.
          </div>
          <div class="r-badges" style="margin-top:10px;">
            <span class="badge" style="font-size:10.5px;">Multi-Camera</span>
            <span class="badge" style="font-size:10.5px;">Event Detection</span>
