        </div>

        <div class="r-proj-card">
          <div class="r-proj-name">Ego-Exo Research</div>
          <div class="r-proj-partner">KAIST Vision AI Lab · Ongoing</div>
          <div class="r-proj-desc">
            Research on cross-view correspondence and transfer learning between egocentric and exocentric video streams. Targeting CVPR-level publication on temporal action-level cycle-consistent alignment.
          </div>
          <div class="r-badges" style="margin-top:10px;">
            <span class="badge" style="font-size:10.5px;">Ego-Exo</span>
            <span class="badge" style="font-size:10.5px;">Self-supervised</span>
